{"ID":"20240118151232-s4qe4gv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151232-s4qe4gv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151232-s4qe4gv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151232-8d7938h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122112520-7130fxw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122112520-7130fxw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:443,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:443\u0026#125;","title":"120雁肪（野鸭）","type":"doc","updated":"20240130140649"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151232-8d7938h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151232-8d7938h","updated":"20240122112504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主风挛拘急，偏枯气不通利，久服益气不饥，轻身耐老。即野鸭。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112508-3dkej90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112508-3dkej90"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】野鸭之脂。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112510-or1kdk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112510-or1kdk9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘平无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112511-980lapa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112511-980lapa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】四肢拘急，半身不遂等偏风。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112512-o2p8zop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112512-o2p8zop"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】无一定剂量，可做食用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112513-1lv2k9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112513-1lv2k9h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】勿与犬肉猪肉牛肉等并煮，主腹泻。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112506-bxt4g46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112506-bxt4g46"}},{"ID":"20240122112514-bqg900q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112514-bqg900q"}},{"ID":"20240122112514-oatf6q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112514-oatf6q9","updated":"20240130140446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第120味药，雁肪。就是野鸭。野鸭呢。我家后院最多。每年冬天的时候。鸭子从北方过来到我家后院。我住佛罗里达嘛。我家后院一票鸭子。那过去佛罗里达很多啊。人家射鸭啊。做那个鼻子，哇哇——学那个鸭叫。就是野鸭。他们在那边射击。打那鸭，猎鸭。"}]},{"ID":"20240122112520-7130fxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112520-7130fxw","updated":"20240130140649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个野鸭的脂肪就是这个。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"专门治疗抽筋。拘急风挛。中风偏枯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个野鸭的脂肪，根据他们打了鸭的回来跟我讲。我是没有吃过。那个鸭子真难吃啊。我想老外可能不会调理。应该很好吃啊。可他们不会调理。要吃野鸭。野鸭那个嘴巴是鸭子那样子嘛。我们那野鸟很多。野鸭是一种。平常吃的时候。只吃鸭的脂肪。那对偏枯有没有用呢。抽筋那拘挛那这种中风抽筋有没用。一定有用。你什么时候看到鸭子拘挛。人家还飞那么长程。北美到南美。我们北美洲到我们佛罗里达最南边。它能够飞一千三百迈啊。你看看他会不会抽筋。当然一定有效的。我是可以收集野鸭的脂肪。上次捎些回来，让他们烧熟回来。现在他们打到，我对他们说脂肪拿来。可是脂肪很少。因为野鸭动得很厉害。脂肪只有一点点。而且脂肪哦很好玩。根据他们跟我讲。它不是在四肢。四肢上面都是肌肉没有脂肪。脂肪都在内脏的中间。然后在那个皮的下方。我想可能是防冻嘛。天气太冷防冻。脂肪很薄一层黄黄的。就是那个。我看能不能收一些回来。这边你在台北开药。你不要写野鸭脂肪二两。。。没有（笑）。这个没有用。"}]}]}